   "mission-critical ERP", "benchmark" and "severe risk surface" left the copy; the rows are lines of a
   page-local class instead of ledger accounts with quantities (SC-150; Data.LedgerRow is left as is); a row becomes dirty
   when a value is written (OnCellSave) rather than when an editor opens (OnCellEdit, which also fired for edits abandoned with
   Escape); the doc table that named a non-existent RowSelectingEventArgs is gone and the code tabs are generated from the page
   (SC-148, SC-149); the unused @ref and the explicit TextEditorTypingBehavior (its default) went; Save is a ButtonControl.
   Parameter tables are a later pass (SC-278).
   2026-10-24 (SC-278): Documentation tables written from Grid/GridControlEvents.cs, Grid/GridModels.cs, Grid/SelectionSettings.cs and
